ts\nPeople Directory\nAlumni & Giving\nStudent Portal\nHome\nAcademics\nDoctoral Degrees\nLuddy Doctoral Degrees in Bloomington\nBloomington doctoral programs\nAdvance knowledge in your field\nWith the Luddy School doctoral programs, you'll have the tools you need to create new knowledge in your chosen field. Our doctoral students gain access to top facilities, expert mentorship, and a network that opens doors.\nBloomington doctoral programs\nPush the boundaries of computing research\nPh. D. Computer Science\nYou'll work alongside leading faculty on advanced research in areas like artificial intelligence, data science, computer vision, and high-performance computing.\nShape tomorrow\u2019s digital world\nPh.D. Information Science\nPursue your Ph.D. in Information Science at IU Bloomington\u2019s Luddy School and become a leader in the evolving field of information technology.\nElevate your expertise\nPh. D. Informatics\nEarn your Ph.D. in Informatics at IU Bloomington and immerse yourself in cutting-edge research in human-computer interaction, health informatics, cybersecurity, and complex systems. This interdisciplinary program at the Luddy School allows you to specialize in a wide array of areas equipping you to lead in academia, government, or the nonprofit sector.\nDrive the future of engineering and AI\nPh. D. Intelligent Systems Engineering\nPursue a Ph.D. in Intelligent Systems Engineering at IU Bloomington and master the use of artificial intelligence, machine learning, robotics, and computational engineering. This program prepares you for leadership roles in industry, government research, and academia.\nOne School. Two Campuses. Infinite Possibilities.\nMore pathways at Luddy Indianapolis\nExplore the options available at IU's urban research campus in the heart of downtown Indianapolis.\nBioInformatics - Computer Science - HCI\nHealth Informatics - Information Science\nReady to start your journey at Luddy? Take the next step!\nRequest Information\nSchedule 